            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-50103",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ASoC: qcom: Fix NULL Dereference in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nASoC: qcom: Fix NULL Dereference in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe()\n\nA devm_kzalloc() in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe() could\npossibly return NULL pointer. NULL Pointer Dereference may be\ntriggerred without addtional check.\nAdd a NULL check for the returned pointer."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50103",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50103\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50103](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50103)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nASoC: qcom: Fix NULL Dereference in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe()\n\nA devm_kzalloc() in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe() could\npossibly return NULL pointer. NULL Pointer Dereference may be\ntriggerred without addtional check.\nAdd a NULL check for the returned pointer.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50103**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50103](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50103)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nASoC: qcom: Fix NULL Dereference in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe()\n\nA devm_kzalloc() in asoc_qcom_lpass_cpu_platform_probe() could\npossibly return NULL pointer. NULL Pointer Dereference may be\ntriggerred without addtional check.\nAdd a NULL check for the returned pointer."
