            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-50124",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: Bluetooth: ISO: Fix UAF on iso_sock_timeout"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: Fix UAF on iso_sock_timeout\n\nconn-\u003esk maybe have been unlinked/freed while waiting for iso_conn_lock\nso this checks if the conn-\u003esk is still valid by checking if it part of\niso_sk_list."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50124",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50124\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50124](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50124)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: Fix UAF on iso_sock_timeout\n\nconn-\u003esk maybe have been unlinked/freed while waiting for iso_conn_lock\nso this checks if the conn-\u003esk is still valid by checking if it part of\niso_sk_list.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50124**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50124](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50124)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: Fix UAF on iso_sock_timeout\n\nconn-\u003esk maybe have been unlinked/freed while waiting for iso_conn_lock\nso this checks if the conn-\u003esk is still valid by checking if it part of\niso_sk_list."
              },
