            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-50137",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: reset: starfive: jh71x0: Fix accessing the empty member on JH7110 SoC"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nreset: starfive: jh71x0: Fix accessing the empty member on JH7110 SoC\n\ndata-\u003easserted will be NULL on JH7110 SoC since commit 82327b127d41\n(\"reset: starfive: Add StarFive JH7110 reset driver\") was added. Add\nthe judgment condition to avoid errors when calling reset_control_status\non JH7110 SoC."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50137",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50137\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50137](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50137)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nreset: starfive: jh71x0: Fix accessing the empty member on JH7110 SoC\n\ndata-\u003easserted will be NULL on JH7110 SoC since commit 82327b127d41\n(\"reset: starfive: Add StarFive JH7110 reset driver\") was added. Add\nthe judgment condition to avoid errors when calling reset_control_status\non JH7110 SoC.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50137**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50137](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50137)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nreset: starfive: jh71x0: Fix accessing the empty member on JH7110 SoC\n\ndata-\u003easserted will be NULL on JH7110 SoC since commit 82327b127d41\n(\"reset: starfive: Add StarFive JH7110 reset driver\") was added. Add\nthe judgment condition to avoid errors when calling reset_control_status\non JH7110 SoC."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
