            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-50283",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in smb3_preauth_hash_rsp"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in smb3_preauth_hash_rsp\n\nksmbd_user_session_put should be called under smb3_preauth_hash_rsp().\nIt will avoid freeing session before calling smb3_preauth_hash_rsp()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50283",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50283\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50283](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50283)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in smb3_preauth_hash_rsp\n\nksmbd_user_session_put should be called under smb3_preauth_hash_rsp().\nIt will avoid freeing session before calling smb3_preauth_hash_rsp().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50283**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50283](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50283)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in smb3_preauth_hash_rsp\n\nksmbd_user_session_put should be called under smb3_preauth_hash_rsp().\nIt will avoid freeing session before calling smb3_preauth_hash_rsp()."
