            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-50286",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in ksmbd_smb2_session_create"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in ksmbd_smb2_session_create\n\nThere is a race condition between ksmbd_smb2_session_create and\nksmbd_expire_session. This patch add missing sessions_table_lock\nwhile adding/deleting session from global session table."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50286",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50286\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50286](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50286)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in ksmbd_smb2_session_create\n\nThere is a race condition between ksmbd_smb2_session_create and\nksmbd_expire_session. This patch add missing sessions_table_lock\nwhile adding/deleting session from global session table.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50286**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50286](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50286)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix slab-use-after-free in ksmbd_smb2_session_create\n\nThere is a race condition between ksmbd_smb2_session_create and\nksmbd_expire_session. This patch add missing sessions_table_lock\nwhile adding/deleting session from global session table."
              },
              "properties": {
