                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50291**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50291](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50291)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: dvb-core: add missing buffer index check\n\ndvb_vb2_expbuf() didn't check if the given buffer index was\nfor a valid buffer. Add this check."
