              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50300",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-50300\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-50300](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50300)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nregulator: rtq2208: Fix uninitialized use of regulator_config\n\nFix rtq2208 driver uninitialized use to cause kernel error.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-50300**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-50300](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-50300)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nregulator: rtq2208: Fix uninitialized use of regulator_config\n\nFix rtq2208 driver uninitialized use to cause kernel error."
