                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53050**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53050](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53050)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915/hdcp: Add encoder check in hdcp2_get_capability\n\nAdd encoder check in intel_hdcp2_get_capability to avoid\nnull pointer error."
