              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: virtio_net: Add hash_key_length check"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvirtio_net: Add hash_key_length check\n\nAdd hash_key_length check in virtnet_probe() to avoid possible out of\nbound errors when setting/reading the hash key."
              },
