                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53082**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53082](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53082)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvirtio_net: Add hash_key_length check\n\nAdd hash_key_length check in virtnet_probe() to avoid possible out of\nbound errors when setting/reading the hash key."
