            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-53086",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/xe: Drop VM dma-resv lock on xe_sync_in_fence_get failure in exec IOCTL"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe: Drop VM dma-resv lock on xe_sync_in_fence_get failure in exec IOCTL\n\nUpon failure all locks need to be dropped before returning to the user.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 7d1a4258e602ffdce529f56686925034c1b3b095)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53086",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-53086\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-53086](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53086)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe: Drop VM dma-resv lock on xe_sync_in_fence_get failure in exec IOCTL\n\nUpon failure all locks need to be dropped before returning to the user.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 7d1a4258e602ffdce529f56686925034c1b3b095)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53086**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53086](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53086)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/xe: Drop VM dma-resv lock on xe_sync_in_fence_get failure in exec IOCTL\n\nUpon failure all locks need to be dropped before returning to the user.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 7d1a4258e602ffdce529f56686925034c1b3b095)"
              },
