                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53110**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53110](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53110)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nvp_vdpa: fix id_table array not null terminated error\n\nAllocate one extra virtio_device_id as null terminator, otherwise\nvdpa_mgmtdev_get_classes() may iterate multiple times and visit\nundefined memory."
