            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-53115",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/vmwgfx: avoid null_ptr_deref in vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/vmwgfx: avoid null_ptr_deref in vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle\n\nThe 'vmw_user_object_buffer' function may return NULL with incorrect\ninputs. To avoid possible null pointer dereference, add a check whether\nthe 'bo' is NULL in the vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53115",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-53115\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-53115](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53115)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/vmwgfx: avoid null_ptr_deref in vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle\n\nThe 'vmw_user_object_buffer' function may return NULL with incorrect\ninputs. To avoid possible null pointer dereference, add a check whether\nthe 'bo' is NULL in the vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53115**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53115](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53115)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/vmwgfx: avoid null_ptr_deref in vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle\n\nThe 'vmw_user_object_buffer' function may return NULL with incorrect\ninputs. To avoid possible null pointer dereference, add a check whether\nthe 'bo' is NULL in the vmw_framebuffer_surface_create_handle."
