            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-53129",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/rockchip: vop: Fix a dereferenced before check warning"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/rockchip: vop: Fix a dereferenced before check warning\n\nThe 'state' can't be NULL, we should check crtc_state.\n\nFix warning:\ndrivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop.c:1096\nvop_plane_atomic_async_check() warn: variable dereferenced before check\n'state' (see line 1077)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53129",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-53129\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-53129](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53129)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/rockchip: vop: Fix a dereferenced before check warning\n\nThe 'state' can't be NULL, we should check crtc_state.\n\nFix warning:\ndrivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop.c:1096\nvop_plane_atomic_async_check() warn: variable dereferenced before check\n'state' (see line 1077)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53129**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53129](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53129)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/rockchip: vop: Fix a dereferenced before check warning\n\nThe 'state' can't be NULL, we should check crtc_state.\n\nFix warning:\ndrivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_vop.c:1096\nvop_plane_atomic_async_check() warn: variable dereferenced before check\n'state' (see line 1077)"
              },
              "properties": {
