            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-53200",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in hwss_setup_dpp"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in hwss_setup_dpp\n\nThis commit addresses a null pointer dereference issue in\nhwss_setup_dpp(). The issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state is\nnull. The fix adds a check to ensure `pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state` is not null\nbefore accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53200",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-53200\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-53200](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53200)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in hwss_setup_dpp\n\nThis commit addresses a null pointer dereference issue in\nhwss_setup_dpp(). The issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state is\nnull. The fix adds a check to ensure `pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state` is not null\nbefore accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53200**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53200](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53200)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in hwss_setup_dpp\n\nThis commit addresses a null pointer dereference issue in\nhwss_setup_dpp(). The issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state is\nnull. The fix adds a check to ensure `pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state` is not null\nbefore accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
