            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-53230",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: cpufreq: CPPC: Fix possible null-ptr-deref for cppc_get_cpu_cost()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncpufreq: CPPC: Fix possible null-ptr-deref for cppc_get_cpu_cost()\n\ncpufreq_cpu_get_raw() may return NULL if the cpu is not in\npolicy-\u003ecpus cpu mask and it will cause null pointer dereference,\nso check NULL for cppc_get_cpu_cost()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53230",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-53230\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-53230](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53230)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncpufreq: CPPC: Fix possible null-ptr-deref for cppc_get_cpu_cost()\n\ncpufreq_cpu_get_raw() may return NULL if the cpu is not in\npolicy-\u003ecpus cpu mask and it will cause null pointer dereference,\nso check NULL for cppc_get_cpu_cost().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-53230**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-53230](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-53230)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ncpufreq: CPPC: Fix possible null-ptr-deref for cppc_get_cpu_cost()\n\ncpufreq_cpu_get_raw() may return NULL if the cpu is not in\npolicy-\u003ecpus cpu mask and it will cause null pointer dereference,\nso check NULL for cppc_get_cpu_cost()."
              },
