            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-56572",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: media: platform: allegro-dvt: Fix possible memory leak in allocate_buffers_internal()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: platform: allegro-dvt: Fix possible memory leak in allocate_buffers_internal()\n\nThe buffer in the loop should be released under the exception path,\notherwise there may be a memory leak here.\n\nTo mitigate this, free the buffer when allegro_alloc_buffer fails."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56572",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-56572\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-56572](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56572)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: platform: allegro-dvt: Fix possible memory leak in allocate_buffers_internal()\n\nThe buffer in the loop should be released under the exception path,\notherwise there may be a memory leak here.\n\nTo mitigate this, free the buffer when allegro_alloc_buffer fails.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-56572**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-56572](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56572)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmedia: platform: allegro-dvt: Fix possible memory leak in allocate_buffers_internal()\n\nThe buffer in the loop should be released under the exception path,\notherwise there may be a memory leak here.\n\nTo mitigate this, free the buffer when allegro_alloc_buffer fails."
              },
