            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-56667",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/i915: Fix NULL pointer dereference in capture_engine"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix NULL pointer dereference in capture_engine\n\nWhen the intel_context structure contains NULL,\nit raises a NULL pointer dereference error in drm_info().\n\n(cherry picked from commit 754302a5bc1bd8fd3b7d85c168b0a1af6d4bba4d)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56667",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-56667\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-60.63\nLink: [CVE-2024-56667](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56667)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix NULL pointer dereference in capture_engine\n\nWhen the intel_context structure contains NULL,\nit raises a NULL pointer dereference error in drm_info().\n\n(cherry picked from commit 754302a5bc1bd8fd3b7d85c168b0a1af6d4bba4d)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-56667**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-60.63|[CVE-2024-56667](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56667)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/i915: Fix NULL pointer dereference in capture_engine\n\nWhen the intel_context structure contains NULL,\nit raises a NULL pointer dereference error in drm_info().\n\n(cherry picked from commit 754302a5bc1bd8fd3b7d85c168b0a1af6d4bba4d)"
