              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nocteontx2-pf: handle otx2_mbox_get_rsp errors in otx2_common.c\n\nAdd error pointer check after calling otx2_mbox_get_rsp()."
              },
