                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-56707**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-56707](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56707)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nocteontx2-pf: handle otx2_mbox_get_rsp errors in otx2_dmac_flt.c\n\nAdd error pointer checks after calling otx2_mbox_get_rsp()."
