            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-56752",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/nouveau/gr/gf100: Fix missing unlock in gf100_gr_chan_new()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/nouveau/gr/gf100: Fix missing unlock in gf100_gr_chan_new()\n\nWhen the call to gf100_grctx_generate() fails, unlock gr-\u003efecs.mutex\nbefore returning the error.\n\nFixes smatch warning:\n\ndrivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/engine/gr/gf100.c:480 gf100_gr_chan_new() warn: inconsistent returns '\u0026gr-\u003efecs.mutex'."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56752",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-56752\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-58.60\nLink: [CVE-2024-56752](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56752)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/nouveau/gr/gf100: Fix missing unlock in gf100_gr_chan_new()\n\nWhen the call to gf100_grctx_generate() fails, unlock gr-\u003efecs.mutex\nbefore returning the error.\n\nFixes smatch warning:\n\ndrivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/engine/gr/gf100.c:480 gf100_gr_chan_new() warn: inconsistent returns '\u0026gr-\u003efecs.mutex'.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-56752**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-58.60|[CVE-2024-56752](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-56752)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/nouveau/gr/gf100: Fix missing unlock in gf100_gr_chan_new()\n\nWhen the call to gf100_grctx_generate() fails, unlock gr-\u003efecs.mutex\nbefore returning the error.\n\nFixes smatch warning:\n\ndrivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/engine/gr/gf100.c:480 gf100_gr_chan_new() warn: inconsistent returns '\u0026gr-\u003efecs.mutex'."
              },
