            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-57887",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm: adv7511: Fix use-after-free in adv7533_attach_dsi()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm: adv7511: Fix use-after-free in adv7533_attach_dsi()\n\nThe host_node pointer was assigned and freed in adv7533_parse_dt(), and\nlater, adv7533_attach_dsi() uses the same. Fix this use-after-free issue\nby dropping of_node_put() in adv7533_parse_dt() and calling of_node_put()\nin error path of probe() and also in the remove()."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-57887",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-57887\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-60.63\nLink: [CVE-2024-57887](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-57887)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm: adv7511: Fix use-after-free in adv7533_attach_dsi()\n\nThe host_node pointer was assigned and freed in adv7533_parse_dt(), and\nlater, adv7533_attach_dsi() uses the same. Fix this use-after-free issue\nby dropping of_node_put() in adv7533_parse_dt() and calling of_node_put()\nin error path of probe() and also in the remove().",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-57887**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-60.63|[CVE-2024-57887](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-57887)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm: adv7511: Fix use-after-free in adv7533_attach_dsi()\n\nThe host_node pointer was assigned and freed in adv7533_parse_dt(), and\nlater, adv7533_attach_dsi() uses the same. Fix this use-after-free issue\nby dropping of_node_put() in adv7533_parse_dt() and calling of_node_put()\nin error path of probe() and also in the remove()."
              },
              "properties": {
