                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-57990**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-64.67|[CVE-2024-57990](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-57990)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7925: fix off by one in mt7925_load_clc()\n\nThis comparison should be \u003e= instead of \u003e to prevent an out of bounds\nread and write."
