            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-58058",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ubifs: skip dumping tnc tree when zroot is null"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nubifs: skip dumping tnc tree when zroot is null\n\nClearing slab cache will free all znode in memory and make\nc-\u003ezroot.znode = NULL, then dumping tnc tree will access\nc-\u003ezroot.znode which cause null pointer dereference."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58058",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-58058\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-64.67\nLink: [CVE-2024-58058](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58058)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nubifs: skip dumping tnc tree when zroot is null\n\nClearing slab cache will free all znode in memory and make\nc-\u003ezroot.znode = NULL, then dumping tnc tree will access\nc-\u003ezroot.znode which cause null pointer dereference.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-58058**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-64.67|[CVE-2024-58058](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-58058)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nubifs: skip dumping tnc tree when zroot is null\n\nClearing slab cache will free all znode in memory and make\nc-\u003ezroot.znode = NULL, then dumping tnc tree will access\nc-\u003ezroot.znode which cause null pointer dereference."
