            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-21941",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: drm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in resource_build_scaling_params"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in resource_build_scaling_params\n\nNull pointer dereference issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state\nis null. The fix adds a check to ensure 'pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state' is not\nnull before accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference.\n\nFound by code review.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 63e6a77ccf239337baa9b1e7787cde9fa0462092)"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21941",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-21941\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-84.84\nLink: [CVE-2025-21941](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21941)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in resource_build_scaling_params\n\nNull pointer dereference issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state\nis null. The fix adds a check to ensure 'pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state' is not\nnull before accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference.\n\nFound by code review.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 63e6a77ccf239337baa9b1e7787cde9fa0462092)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-21941**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-84.84|[CVE-2025-21941](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21941)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: Fix null check for pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state in resource_build_scaling_params\n\nNull pointer dereference issue could occur when pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state\nis null. The fix adds a check to ensure 'pipe_ctx-\u003eplane_state' is not\nnull before accessing. This prevents a null pointer dereference.\n\nFound by code review.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 63e6a77ccf239337baa9b1e7787cde9fa0462092)"
              },
