            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-21944",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: ksmbd: fix bug on trap in smb2_lock"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix bug on trap in smb2_lock\n\nIf lock count is greater than 1, flags could be old value.\nIt should be checked with flags of smb_lock, not flags.\nIt will cause bug-on trap from locks_free_lock in error handling\nroutine."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21944",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-21944\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-84.84\nLink: [CVE-2025-21944](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21944)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix bug on trap in smb2_lock\n\nIf lock count is greater than 1, flags could be old value.\nIt should be checked with flags of smb_lock, not flags.\nIt will cause bug-on trap from locks_free_lock in error handling\nroutine.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-21944**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-84.84|[CVE-2025-21944](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21944)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: fix bug on trap in smb2_lock\n\nIf lock count is greater than 1, flags could be old value.\nIt should be checked with flags of smb_lock, not flags.\nIt will cause bug-on trap from locks_free_lock in error handling\nroutine."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
