            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-21982",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: pinctrl: nuvoton: npcm8xx: Add NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\npinctrl: nuvoton: npcm8xx: Add NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw\n\ndevm_kasprintf() calls can return null pointers on failure.\nBut the return values were not checked in npcm8xx_gpio_fw().\nAdd NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw(), to handle kernel NULL\npointer dereference error."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21982",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-21982\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-84.84\nLink: [CVE-2025-21982](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21982)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\npinctrl: nuvoton: npcm8xx: Add NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw\n\ndevm_kasprintf() calls can return null pointers on failure.\nBut the return values were not checked in npcm8xx_gpio_fw().\nAdd NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw(), to handle kernel NULL\npointer dereference error.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-21982**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-84.84|[CVE-2025-21982](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-21982)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\npinctrl: nuvoton: npcm8xx: Add NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw\n\ndevm_kasprintf() calls can return null pointers on failure.\nBut the return values were not checked in npcm8xx_gpio_fw().\nAdd NULL check in npcm8xx_gpio_fw(), to handle kernel NULL\npointer dereference error."
