              "id": "CVE-2025-22008",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: regulator: check that dummy regulator has been probed before using it"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nregulator: check that dummy regulator has been probed before using it\n\nDue to asynchronous driver probing there is a chance that the dummy\nregulator hasn't already been probed when first accessing it."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-22008",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-22008\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-84.84\nLink: [CVE-2025-22008](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-22008)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nregulator: check that dummy regulator has been probed before using it\n\nDue to asynchronous driver probing there is a chance that the dummy\nregulator hasn't already been probed when first accessing it.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-22008**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-84.84|[CVE-2025-22008](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-22008)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nregulator: check that dummy regulator has been probed before using it\n\nDue to asynchronous driver probing there is a chance that the dummy\nregulator hasn't already been probed when first accessing it."
              },
              "properties": {
