            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-37937",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "kernel: objtool, media: dib8000: Prevent divide-by-zero in dib8000_set_dds()"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nobjtool, media: dib8000: Prevent divide-by-zero in dib8000_set_dds()\n\nIf dib8000_set_dds()'s call to dib8000_read32() returns zero, the result\nis a divide-by-zero.  Prevent that from happening.\n\nFixes the following warning with an UBSAN kernel:\n\n  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/dib8000.o: warning: objtool: dib8000_tune() falls through to next function dib8096p_cfg_DibRx()"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37937",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-37937\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: linux-libc-dev\nFixed Version: 6.8.0-86.87\nLink: [CVE-2025-37937](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37937)\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nobjtool, media: dib8000: Prevent divide-by-zero in dib8000_set_dds()\n\nIf dib8000_set_dds()'s call to dib8000_read32() returns zero, the result\nis a divide-by-zero.  Prevent that from happening.\n\nFixes the following warning with an UBSAN kernel:\n\n  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/dib8000.o: warning: objtool: dib8000_tune() falls through to next function dib8096p_cfg_DibRx()",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-37937**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|linux-libc-dev|6.8.0-86.87|[CVE-2025-37937](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37937)|\n\nIn the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nobjtool, media: dib8000: Prevent divide-by-zero in dib8000_set_dds()\n\nIf dib8000_set_dds()'s call to dib8000_read32() returns zero, the result\nis a divide-by-zero.  Prevent that from happening.\n\nFixes the following warning with an UBSAN kernel:\n\n  drivers/media/dvb-frontends/dib8000.o: warning: objtool: dib8000_tune() falls through to next function dib8096p_cfg_DibRx()"
              },
